ic Scion cover images never available as shirts before, so yes: new.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T01:06:29-07:00","id":92174,"title":"","content":"Looks great. Particularly interested in some of the Vampire ones and the Bridgette shirt. So, I guess we will see the Mage shirts after the KS ends. Do you know when we'll be able to see the designs for V20 and Mummy?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T04:48:23-07:00","id":92236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/91753-scion-t-shirts?p=92073#post92073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Iconic Scion cover images never available as shirts before, so yes: new.</div> </div> </div> </div>The shirts yes. The art no.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-16T13:58:30-07:00","id":92459,"title":"","content":"While awesome I'd prefer pantheon shirts. Still pretty cool though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Every normal man must be tempted at times to spit upon his hands, hoist the black flag, and begin slitting throats.&quot;<br /> -H.L. Mencken","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2486-irisheathen","name":"Irisheathen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2486_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T02:42:14-07:00","id":92705,"title":"","content":"Umm I don't know if I should say this but I know a website that could make any t-shirt with any image on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1837-wickedgrail","name":"Wickedgrail","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1837_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-17T02:58:51-07:00","id":92711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wickedgrail</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/91753-scion-t-shirts?p=92705#post92705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Umm I don't know if I should say this but I know a website that could make any t-shirt with any image on it.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's literally what RedBubble is.<br /> <br /> The difference is that this is our official store, and we have the source graphics necessary to provide high-detail shirts. If we found others selling shirts with our IP, we would be well within our rights to shut them down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-19T22:58:15-07:00","id":94724,"title":"","content":"Scion was the first game in my long history of roleplaying that I decided to play a stock character. Eric was written like something I'd play so I swallowed my usual ego and did it. Now for the first time ever I will have a shirt with my own character on it...I am seriously stoked and my shirt has been ordered. Now if only the second edition would come out already.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Things need not have happened to be true. Tales and dreams are the shadow truths that will endure when mere facts are dust and ashes, and forgot.&quot; Sandman (Neil Gaiman)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/733-troller","name":"Troller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-13T16:10:25-07:00","id":112299,"title":"","content":"Scion shirts were taken down temporarily, since they seemed to be printing a little too dark. We've tweaked the designs and they're back up now.<br /> <br /> And they're joined by seven other shirt designs featuring the pantheons!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.redbubble.com/people/theonyxpath/collections/269896-scion\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.redbubble.com/people/theo...s/269896-scion</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-14T00:40:53-07:00","id":112466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/91753-scion-t-shirts?p=112299#post112299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And they're joined by seven other shirt designs featuring the pantheons![/url]</div> </div> </div> </div>Very cool! The pantheon designs look especially good, being so full of symbolism and all. I LOVE the Atzl\u00e1nti design. One question though; I see the core pantheons, and the Celestial Bureaucracy. Are there plans to do any more pantheons? I'd absolutely buy the Yazata and Deva symbols when/if you put them on shirts. :-D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1449-zakariya-ali-sher","name":"Zakariya Ali Sher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T08:43:40-07:00","id":113353,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I was wondering about that. Since we have a Celestial Bureaucracy shirt, does that mean that that pantheon made the cut for Scion 2.0?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T12:40:41-07:00","id":113487,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't read anything into which ones were put up. They are just what we did in this wave of shirts, and we'll be doing batches as time permits between other book related projects. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"ran